{"id":"26dafbc0a373cac4","group":"92","path":"92/92-thm-modal-translation-soundness.md","title":"Soundness of K4 and G under Abstract Translations","display":"thm-modal-translation-soundness — Soundness of K4 and G under Abstract Translations","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-thm-modal-translation-soundness","aliases":["92-thm-modal-translation-soundness"],"display":"thm-modal-translation-soundness — Soundness of K4 and G under Abstract Translations","source":"第 XI 章 pp. 133–134（PDF 150–151）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-df-modal-k-k4-g]]","[[92-df-modal-abstract-translation]]","[[92-df-type-g-provability-system]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-thm-modal-translation-soundness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-thm-modal-translation-soundness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-modal-translation-soundness — Soundness of K4 and G under Abstract Translations"},{"key":"source","html":"第 XI 章 pp. 133–134（PDF 150–151）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e69e849d9714457a\" href=\"?note=e69e849d9714457a\" title=\"92-df-modal-k-k4-g\">92-df-modal-k-k4-g</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4339a848b5e63fc1\" href=\"?note=4339a848b5e63fc1\" title=\"92-df-modal-abstract-translation\">92-df-modal-abstract-translation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3c0bfff14ec726c0\" href=\"?note=3c0bfff14ec726c0\" title=\"92-df-type-g-provability-system\">92-df-type-g-provability-system</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(S,f,\\Rightarrow,P,B)\">\\(M=(S,f,\\Rightarrow,P,B)\\)</span> 是抽象可证系统；Type4、TypeG 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3c0bfff14ec726c0\" href=\"?note=3c0bfff14ec726c0\" title=\"92-df-type-g-provability-system\">92-df-type-g-provability-system</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_\\rho^M\">\\(\\tau_\\rho^M\\)</span> 见上游。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProvSys}(M)\">\\(\\mathrm{ProvSys}(M)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Type4},\\mathrm{TypeG}\">\\(\\mathrm{Type4},\\mathrm{TypeG}\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3c0bfff14ec726c0\" href=\"?note=3c0bfff14ec726c0\" title=\"92-df-type-g-provability-system\">92-df-type-g-provability-system</a> 的性质。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}modal\\text{-}translation\\text{-}soundness}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n(\\mathrm{Type4}(M)\\land(\\mathsf{K4}_{\\Box}\\vdash F))&amp;\\Rightarrow\n\\forall\\rho:\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\to S\\;\\tau_\\rho^M(F)\\in P,\\\\\n(\\mathrm{TypeG}(M)\\land(\\mathsf G_{\\Box}\\vdash F))&amp;\\Rightarrow\n\\forall\\rho:\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\to S\\;\\tau_\\rho^M(F)\\in P.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}modal\\text{-}translation\\text{-}soundness}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n(\\mathrm{Type4}(M)\\land(\\mathsf{K4}_{\\Box}\\vdash F))&amp;\\Rightarrow\n\\forall\\rho:\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\to S\\;\\tau_\\rho^M(F)\\in P,\\\\\n(\\mathrm{TypeG}(M)\\land(\\mathsf G_{\\Box}\\vdash F))&amp;\\Rightarrow\n\\forall\\rho:\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\to S\\;\\tau_\\rho^M(F)\\in P.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对有限证明归纳：重言式的翻译是 M 的重言元素，Type1 保证它属于 P；A2、A3 分别由 P2、P3 保证；A4 是 TypeG 条件。MP 由 Type1 的封闭性保持，Nec 由 Normal 保持。</p>\n<p>此方向不要求 M 一致、稳定或存在全局固定点，也不提供特指标准 PA 的 Solovay 逆方向。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-modal-k-k4-g","status":"resolved","id":"e69e849d9714457a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-modal-k-k4-g]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-modal-abstract-translation","status":"resolved","id":"4339a848b5e63fc1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-modal-abstract-translation]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-type-g-provability-system","status":"resolved","id":"3c0bfff14ec726c0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-type-g-provability-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-type-g-provability-system","status":"resolved","id":"3c0bfff14ec726c0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$M=(S,f,\\Rightarrow,P,B)$ 是抽象可证系统；Type4、TypeG 见 [[92-df-type-g-provability-system]]。","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-type-g-provability-system","status":"resolved","id":"3c0bfff14ec726c0","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ProvSys}(M)$；$\\mathrm{Type4},\\mathrm{TypeG}$ 是 [[92-df-type-g-provability-system]] 的性质。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M=(S,f,\\Rightarrow,P,B)","display":false},{"tex":"F\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_\\rho^M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProvSys}(M)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Type4},\\mathrm{TypeG}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}modal\\text{-}translation\\text{-}soundness}\\vdash\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n(\\mathrm{Type4}(M)\\land(\\mathsf{K4}_{\\Box}\\vdash F))&\\Rightarrow\n\\forall\\rho:\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\to S\\;\\tau_\\rho^M(F)\\in P,\\\\\n(\\mathrm{TypeG}(M)\\land(\\mathsf G_{\\Box}\\vdash F))&\\Rightarrow\n\\forall\\rho:\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\to S\\;\\tau_\\rho^M(F)\\in P.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1578,"backlinks":[{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-123","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-modal-abstract-translation]] → [[92-thm-modal-translation-soundness]]；[[92-df-modal-arithmetic-realization]] → [[92-thm-smullyan-solovay-completeness]]。"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-287","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-thm-modal-translation-soundness]]"}],"outgoing":["e69e849d9714457a","4339a848b5e63fc1","3c0bfff14ec726c0"]}